Mainsail CNC is an independent early-stage customization by dung-adumbs,
developed with substantial implementation/documentation assistance from
ChatGPT / OpenAI Codex. Released under GPL-3.0-or-later.

Mainsail: https://github.com/mainsail-crew/mainsail
Klipper: https://github.com/Klipper3d/klipper
Moonraker: https://github.com/Arksine/moonraker
Mainsail configuration/macros: https://github.com/mainsail-crew/mainsail-config

The example CNC macros adapt Mainsail's PAUSE/RESUME client-variable and saved
G-code-state conventions. Retain upstream licensing and notices when adapting
or redistributing upstream code. No compiled Mainsail application or complete
Klipper distribution is included here. Screenshots show Mainsail with the
project's customization. This is not endorsed by the upstream projects.

The initial source was extracted from the owner's working LowRider V4 setup.
Machine identifiers in the DOM and macro names are retained for compatibility.
Generic configuration and additional-machine validation remain planned work.
